{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note:</strong> The visuals shown are from an early development stage and do not represent the final product.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desktop Town</strong> is a relaxing <strong>idle city builder</strong> that runs directly on your desktop. <strong>Build</strong>\u00a0and <strong>decorate</strong> your own tiny town, or\u00a0<strong>watch</strong> your little citizens go about their day, while doing your usual tasks on the PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of modular blocks to design your town exactly the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/cbb1754df3fe0f2a6990e524a95eda68.poster.avif?t=1751443752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/cbb1754df3fe0f2a6990e524a95eda68.webm?t=1751443752\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add plants, lanterns, and a wide range of other decorations to bring your town to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f81dbb1dbd185aec69dbb3def8fd76fb.poster.avif?t=1751443752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f81dbb1dbd185aec69dbb3def8fd76fb.mp4?t=1751443752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When there\u2019s nothing else to do, simply watch your citizens as they wander around and go about their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/635e7cd9a2bf96192e755541ba18ad55.poster.avif?t=1751443752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/635e7cd9a2bf96192e755541ba18ad55.webm?t=1751443752\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748960?t=1751443752","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748960?t=1751443752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/e4811f900b852f64168d24e43c60d433a1a004de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751443752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/e4811f900b852f64168d24e43c60d433a1a004de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751443752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note:</strong> The visuals shown are from an early development stage and do not represent the final product.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desktop Town</strong> is a relaxing <strong>idle city builder</strong> that runs directly on your desktop. <strong>Build</strong>\u00a0and <strong>decorate</strong> your own tiny town, or\u00a0<strong>watch</strong> your little citizens go about their day, while doing your usual tasks on the PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of modular blocks to design your town exactly the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/cbb1754df3fe0f2a6990e524a95eda68.poster.avif?t=1751443752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/cbb1754df3fe0f2a6990e524a95eda68.webm?t=1751443752\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add plants, lanterns, and a wide range of other decorations to bring your town to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f81dbb1dbd185aec69dbb3def8fd76fb.poster.avif?t=1751443752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f81dbb1dbd185aec69dbb3def8fd76fb.mp4?t=1751443752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Watch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When there\u2019s nothing else to do, simply watch your citizens as they wander around and go about their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/635e7cd9a2bf96192e755541ba18ad55.poster.avif?t=1751443752\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/635e7cd9a2bf96192e755541ba18ad55.webm?t=1751443752\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p>","developers":["EdelErde"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c